{"creditedName":"ろん","creatorId":"vndb:s15991","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s15991","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s15991","name":"ろん","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:126172","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"新田 高史","creatorId":"vndb:s34916","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s34916","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s34916","name":"新田高史","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:126173","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"竹内 まりや","creatorId":"vndb:s52293","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s52293","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s52293","name":"竹内 まりや","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:126176","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c161967","characterName":"文野 亜弥","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c161967"},"originalCharacterName":"文野 亜弥","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"18"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Aya was Takayuki's penpal. Clear-headed, attractive and physically active."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"A talented young woman who died of an illness 25 years ago at age 18."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From √Letter PREMIUM ARTBOOK"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c161967"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/68/685a763bed581559fdbde6078706331877402466719f148bd216e6ec178c90b7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3e/3e0528f1c12200a5b52a80bf9e2034f4276851c1fb3fc89bd9bd20067d5f5cc1.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c161968","characterName":"石原 由香里","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c161968"},"originalCharacterName":"石原 由香里","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"32"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A curator at the Shimane Art Museum."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Her father works at a local advertising agency. Her mother works part-time at a diner. As a child, Yukari was always compared to her talented older sister and developed a complex. During high school, this was compounded by the fact that her sister attended a national university. Shiori was the first friend that she could confide in."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Presently she has a promising career at the art museum curating successful exhibits, but dealing with staff who are older (sarcastic middle-aged men) is putting a strain on her. Her favourite saying is, \"Let's do our best.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from √Letter PREMIUM ARTBOOK"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c161968"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d6/d63cebedff8b137916ad666e7f7672fb4b45eebbde2f08d6ad9faf32f0297b1f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/67/67473629ad8806a10078aa654521941027e04fb5d5fa9743a507a5c4c3949bd1.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c161969","characterName":"吉岡 栞","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c161969"},"originalCharacterName":"吉岡 栞","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"32"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":true,"text":"A young girl who pretended to be Aya fifteen years earlier."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She comes from a single-parent home. The father she adored died in an accident during the winter of her first year in middle school. In the spring of her second year, she moved to Matsue due to her mother's job, and the first friend she made at the school where she transferred was Yukari."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Fifteen years ago, she was the one who exchanged letters with Takayuki. The fact that she didn't let him know that she only pretended to be Aya (that she lied) has bothered her all this time. She wants to see him, but she can't act on it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from √Letter PREMIUM ARTBOOK"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c161969"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d9/d9399e411f6480b0f93b11cb0351d764e75e2a3454c11b281c557ccbafe69de8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dd/dd9924860249b5687509949f50b3535880321321ad3ea4983042e26145965a3c.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c161971","characterName":"泉小雲","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c161971"},"originalCharacterName":"泉小雲","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A mysterious old man who always magically appears in places that Nakamura Takayuki visits. He enjoys public baths and likes to tease."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c161971"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/94/94ae88c64e55675943e3e250d01c18649b46c1226b00ecaf07b4377c5d42d8df.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/aa/aa5714f18cfb8a0bf603ec04a23708cffd8234e4e7d0ea3d9f95f133a32cdc8b.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c43186","characterName":"吉岡 栞","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c43186"},"originalCharacterName":"吉岡 栞","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Born in Tokyo. The oldest of three sisters. Blood-Hard-working with a serious personality. She’s the wholehearted type who does her best when it comes to the nitty-gritty. She’s fond of AYA and YUKARI’s talents."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Gematsu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c43186"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e5/e5d46148da3d6d37279dce9512f8b1955c099a94fbd0756032c5571f4c217583.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/17/1766d4bf982c3a326076d085b53ab7d64cc7df04dea65017d39e2490b3e3ec11.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"皆口 裕子","creatorId":"vndb:s1937","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1937","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1937","name":"皆口 裕子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:67284","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c43187","characterName":"文野 亜弥","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c43187"},"originalCharacterName":"文野 亜弥","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Born in Tokyo. An only child. She likes Japanese history and culture (Japanese architecture, clothing, food, etc.). She also has interest in Japanese mythology and folklore."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Gematsu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c43187"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ff/ff2a61becf5111f14da632be521bdd952f1a949f8ae1e252c5fa0ed114756eac.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9a/9a1f880e50a6630d03a460e1f228194737b145e2cfdd10d9f3b45e4de4c2d8a0.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"日高 のり子","creatorId":"vndb:s1656","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1656","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1656","name":"日髙のり子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:67285","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c43188","characterName":"石原 由香里","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c43188"},"originalCharacterName":"石原 由香里","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Born in Kanagawa. She has an older brother. A genius. She can do whatever she is made to do skillfully, but since she is disinterested, she often plays the supporting role."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Gematsu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c43188"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ab/abd73869181d452350b22d933ab3850da4efcd29c0b5d6fc3fdee75f27b3d865.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9b/9b3fef62491a636002942f9530b8de8eddafe8ea912805743793c5977b93fe17.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"井上 喜久子","creatorId":"vndb:s473","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s473","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s473","name":"井上喜久子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:67282","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"月野 もあ","creatorId":"vndb:s19770","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s19770","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s19770","name":"月野 もあ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:67293","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c43189","characterName":"中村 貴之","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c43189"},"originalCharacterName":"中村 貴之","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"33"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A man who lives in Tokyo. 15 years ago, although he had good will towards his pen pal Aya Fumino, when there was no reply to his 10th letter, he began to hate her. 15 years later, he discovers a mysterious 11th letter, and visits Matsue in Shimane Prefecture in order to find her and learn the truth about what happened to her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Gematsu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c43189"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[{"creditedName":"山寺 宏一","creatorId":"vndb:s10965","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s10965","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s10965","name":"山寺宏一","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:67288","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c43190","characterName":"田中 耕介","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c43190"},"originalCharacterName":"田中 耕介","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"33"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A man who works for the Matsue City Council Complaints Department."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"He refuses to talk about Aya Fumino, but his real identity appears to be the “Megane” (Four-Eyes) friend Aya wrote about in her letters. Although said to be the school’s utmost prodigy at the time, his grades began to fall after the summer of senior year in high school, and he didn’t make it into his university of choice. But he graduated from a nameless college, and although he holds down a steady job at City Hall, does not enjoy his life."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His favorite phrase is “~desu yo ne” (“isn’t it?”). He has a bit of a stutter and a polite tone when he speaks, but no confidence in himself. And he is not yet freed from the spell he fell under 15 years ago."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Gematsu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c43190"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/61/619b5fc375674b7d40b54cf48219f7b51e759c5e93700eeb80eeb594eb781350.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bb/bbe9134b564d4435beaf0591da643a5d30d7fa6c0c1da7104b6c934822ac25b5.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岩崎 ひろし","creatorId":"vndb:s17315","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s17315","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s17315","name":"岩崎 ひろし","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:67292","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c71408","characterName":"大森 準","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c71408"},"originalCharacterName":"大森 準","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dedicated to the art of making exquisite pastries and sweets, Omori owns one of the best patisseries in Shimane. He has a kind and gentle demeanour, but does this hide a dark secret? Fun Fact: The Pastry shop in Root Letter is actually based on a real world shop called Patisserie Galette. Thestor’s primary mission is to make French pastries that suit the Japanese palette!"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"from Gematsu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c71408"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a0/a08b1df47bef414c565db874e4c1941fbb665abc0958ee86eee3de49bb2abc1c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2e/2e85ab08feb2022c836df529b0bc832433a18d182746765759f3003c104d0a89.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"河本 啓佑","creatorId":"vndb:s11000","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s11000","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s11000","name":"河本 啓佑","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:67289","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c71409","characterName":"渡辺 将也","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c71409"},"originalCharacterName":"渡辺 将也","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"One minute he was high school’s star athlete dreaming of becoming a professional baseball player. The next minute he’s injured and consigned to the side-lines. The tragedy was too much to take and so he fell in with the wrong crowd and was destined for a life of petty crime. Now, as an adult, he’s turned himself around, teaching PE at the local school. What was it that brought him back from the brink?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"from Gematsu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c71409"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0a/0ab4774499174ce3ceabb2fbf0d4c87512802fc85d0f256d117200cd02b44997.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/27/274fc2614f9bcd0222396f3e817ad8fc4146183c4f036f9656e826fcb4ec1969.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"白川 周作","creatorId":"vndb:s2129","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2129","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2129","name":"白川 周作","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:67287","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c71410","characterName":"村上 美咲","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c71410"},"originalCharacterName":"村上 美咲","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A television presenter for a local channel, Misaki’s family runs a sake brewery. She is sometimes a little blunt and rude and craves the life of a serious news reporter. She believes that she must be impartial and report the truth – but isn’t that just a little hypocritical given the events of the past?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Gematsu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c71410"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateC